1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,571
Hello.

2
00:00:00,571 --> 00:00:01,333
Namaste.

3
00:00:01,333 --> 00:00:02,190
Vanakkam.

4
00:00:02,190 --> 00:00:03,238
Konnichiwa.

5
00:00:03,238 --> 00:00:04,095
Marhaban.

6
00:00:04,095 --> 00:00:04,857
Privyet.

7
00:00:04,857 --> 00:00:12,095
PolyglotFormFill speaks your language, and that means the whole application,

8
00:00:12,095 --> 00:00:13,905
not only the forms.

9
00:00:13,905 --> 00:00:20,857
Buttons, tabs, prompts and messages are shown in the language you choose,

10
00:00:20,857 --> 00:00:28,000
in twenty-six languages, picked on first run and changed whenever you like.

11
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,495
The very first screen already asks which language you want,

12
00:00:32,495 --> 00:00:39,200
before you sign in to anything, because a first screen you cannot read is no use at all.

13
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:44,229
Right-to-left languages, such as Arabic, Hebrew, Urdu and Persian,

14
00:00:44,229 --> 00:00:46,133
flip the whole interface.

15
00:00:46,133 --> 00:00:50,929
Here is the same application in Tamil, and here in Japanese.

16
00:00:50,929 --> 00:00:55,566
Your saved details keep whatever script you typed them in.

17
00:00:55,566 --> 00:01:02,600
A name written in Japanese stays Japanese, and is never transliterated behind your back.

18
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:05,583
Everything happens on your own device.

19
00:01:05,583 --> 00:01:09,823
Forms are read, filled, translated and signed locally.

20
00:01:09,823 --> 00:01:12,649
We never see your form or your data.

21
00:01:12,649 --> 00:01:18,773
It goes only where you choose to send it, such as the office you submit it to.

22
00:01:18,773 --> 00:01:23,483
The app opens on the Licence tab, which is verified offline.

23
00:01:23,483 --> 00:01:26,467
During the beta every feature is free.

24
00:01:26,467 --> 00:01:28,626
Next is Profile and Vault.

25
00:01:28,626 --> 00:01:33,941
Your details, name, date of birth, address, photo and signature,

26
00:01:33,941 --> 00:01:36,765
are sealed at rest on this device.

27
00:01:36,765 --> 00:01:38,509
You can type them in,

28
00:01:38,509 --> 00:01:46,067
or scan a passport or driving licence and let on-device text recognition read them for you.

29
00:01:46,067 --> 00:01:47,806
Now the filling itself.

30
00:01:47,806 --> 00:01:54,611
A P D F with real form fields is completed straight from your vault, including drop-downs,

31
00:01:54,611 --> 00:01:58,694
radio buttons and tick boxes, not only the text boxes.

32
00:01:58,694 --> 00:02:02,248
If the form is a scan, or has no fields at all,

33
00:02:02,248 --> 00:02:07,767
on-device text recognition finds the boxes, creates them, and fills them.

34
00:02:07,767 --> 00:02:12,455
Word documents and Excel spreadsheets are filled the same way,

35
00:02:12,455 --> 00:02:15,933
through their named fields and labelled cells.

36
00:02:15,933 --> 00:02:19,919
The browser extension does the same work for web forms.

37
00:02:19,919 --> 00:02:25,499
Open a form in Chrome or Edge and it fills the page from the very same vault.

38
00:02:25,499 --> 00:02:30,209
Extension and desktop application share one vault, automatically.

39
00:02:30,209 --> 00:02:36,658
Save a detail in the browser and the desktop app already has it, and the other way round.

40
00:02:36,658 --> 00:02:39,194
Nothing is copied through a server.

41
00:02:39,194 --> 00:02:42,600
The two talk to each other on your own machine.

42
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:49,554
Anything you type onto a form that your vault does not already hold is offered back to you afterwards.

43
00:02:49,554 --> 00:02:53,372
You see the label, the value, and what it would replace,

44
00:02:53,372 --> 00:02:55,894
and only the ones you tick are saved.

45
00:02:55,894 --> 00:03:00,940
Every form you fill is kept in Past forms as an encrypted, versioned copy,

46
00:03:00,940 --> 00:03:03,667
and can be downloaded again at any time.

47
00:03:03,667 --> 00:03:09,421
You can sign a finished form with this device's own key, created offline.

48
00:03:09,421 --> 00:03:13,520
Signatures can be drawn on screen in any ink colour,

49
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:17,067
because plenty of authorities insist on blue.

50
00:03:17,067 --> 00:03:21,385
So: any form, any language, on your own device.

51
00:03:21,385 --> 00:03:28,367
The Docs and Video tab holds this walkthrough and the written documentation.

52
00:03:28,367 --> 00:03:30,020
Private by design.

53
00:03:30,020 --> 00:03:32,133
Thank you for watching.

